WEBVTT

00:11:57.624 --> 00:12:00.569
Every day, three rhinos are killed,

00:12:00.593 --> 00:12:04.656
because there are people
who think that those horns are valuable,

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.884
even though they're just made
of the same stuff

00:12:06.908 --> 00:12:08.575
as hair and fingernails.

00:12:09.891 --> 00:12:11.157
It breaks my heart.

00:12:13.106 --> 00:12:15.915
Like all good recovering heroes,

00:12:15.939 --> 00:12:19.680
I did everything I could
to reduce this goal

00:12:19.704 --> 00:12:22.304
to something that I could do by myself.

00:12:23.085 --> 00:12:28.015
But clearly, stopping rhino poaching
is a goal way too big for me.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.585
So I'm immediately
in interdependence land.